<title>INDIA: Analysis of India Ambuja results v rest.</title>
<headline>Analysis of India Ambuja results v rest.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Gujarat Ambuja Cements said on Tuesday it outperformed other major Indian cement firms in key parameters.</p>
<p>Comparative analysis of major cement companies in 1996</p>
<p>							(in rupees million)</p>
<p>		 Gujarat   ACC   Birla   Chettinad   India   Madras</p>
<p>		 Ambuja	    Jute	Cement   Cements  Cement</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>(Year ending)  30/6    31/3   31/3	31/3	31/3     31/3</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Sales	   7,304  23,429  10,646    1,967     7,904    3,795</p>
<p>Operating</p>
<p> Profit	 2,542   3,765   1,101	607     1,404    1,243</p>
<p>Interest	  548     980     399	132	 389	194</p>
<p>Depreciation    597     632     263	171	 366	250</p>
<p>Other Income     82     710     244	  9	 160	126</p>
<p>Profit before</p>
<p> tax	    1,478   2,863     683	313	 809	925</p>
<p>Net Profit    1,478   2,268     438	313	 809	909</p>
<p>O/P Margin(%)   35%     16%     10%	31%	 18%	33%</p>
<p>G/P Margin(%)   27%     12%	7%	24%	 13%	28%</p>
<p>N/P Margin(%)   20%     10%	4%	16%	 10%	24%</p>
<p>Dividend	  50%     70%     35%	50%	 45%	55%</p>
<p>E.P.S.(Rs)	 20     167	14	 37	  13	758</p>
<p>Production (million.</p>
<p>  tonnes)	3.06    8.93    3.55     0.91	2.59     1.83</p>
<p>O/P Profit per</p>
<p>  tonne (Rs)    830     422     310	667	 542	679</p>
<p>Equity	    735   1,355     306	 84	 643	120</p>
<p>Source-Gujarat Ambuja Cements</p>
